      "message": "java.Module uses the aconfig files of only its [static dependencies](https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:build/soong/java/base.go;l\u003d2459;drc\u003d454ac2b3e6024e004f7665dc07b6c3d23d1fd4fb;bpv\u003d0;bpt\u003d1). Should `java_api_library` restrict this to `staticLibTag` deps as well?",
